	<item>
		<title>[US] Target LEGO November 2026 Deals Continue: Retiring Soon Star Wars Battle of Felucia Separatist MTT (20% off), Toy Story Lotso (40% off) &#038; More</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-november-2026-deals-continue-retiring-soon-star-wars-battle-of-felucia-separatist-mtt-20-off-toy-story-lotso-40-off-more/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-november-2026-deals-continue-retiring-soon-star-wars-battle-of-felucia-separatist-mtt-20-off-toy-story-lotso-40-off-more/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
