		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114903</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="656" height="918" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Insiders Weekend November 21-22, 2026 GWP Gift with Purchase Promotions - 40918 Winter Snow Globe and 40914 Retro Jukebox Banner Ad Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 656w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo-214x300.jpg 214w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 656px) 100vw, 656px" /></p>
<p>This year&#8217;s Insiders Weekend November 2026 has been revealed LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). There will be a wide range of</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-insiders-weekend-promotions-revealed-double-points-gwp-gift-with-purchases-sale-november-21-22-2026/">LEGO Insiders Weekend Promotions Revealed: Double Points, GWP Gift with Purchases &#038; Sale (November 21-22, 2026)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114905 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="1317" height="457" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg 1317w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-300x104.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-1024x355.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-Membership-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-768x266.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1317px) 100vw, 1317px" /></p>
<p>This year&#8217;s Insiders Weekend November 2026 has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). There will be a wide range of promotions, GWP Gift with Purchases, Insiders sale and more. Insiders Reward membership is required to take advantage of the offer (free to join). Most of the offers run for 2 days only from November 21-22, 2026. However, the Insiders Member Sale will run for a few more extra days from November 21-26, 2026. Check it all out below in this article.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the Insiders Weekend 2026 goes live!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>Double Insiders Reward Points Promotion</h3>
<p>From November 21 to 22, 2026, you can get double Insiders Reward points on LEGO purchases at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). That&#8217;s basically 10% back in LEGO reward dollars.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113527 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="783" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 783w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo-300x176.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 783px) 100vw, 783px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP Promotion</h3>
<p>From November 21-22, 2026, you can get the limited edition LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP gift set for free when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="870" height="883" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp 1182w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1009x1024.webp 1009w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-768x780.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1024x1040.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 870px) 100vw, 870px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114894 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="930" height="942" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp 1185w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1011x1024.webp 1011w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-768x778.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1024x1037.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 930px) 100vw, 930px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP Promotion</h3>
<p>From November 21-22, 2026, you can get the limited edition LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift set for free when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114881 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="531" height="753" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-722x1024.webp 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-768x1089.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 531px) 100vw, 531px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114890 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="520" height="736" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp 847w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-723x1024.webp 723w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-768x1088.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px" /></p>
<h3>Insiders Member Sale</h3>
<p>For six days only from November 21 to November 26, 2026, you can get Insiders Member Sale Price on selected items. You must be logged in to your LEGO Insiders (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) account in order to see the savings at checkout. Note that we do not know what items will be on sale yet. But we will know closer to the date.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104810 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Insiders-Member-Sale-Discounts-Savings-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="776" height="455" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Insiders-Member-Sale-Discounts-Savings-Logo-Banner.jpg 776w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Insiders-Member-Sale-Discounts-Savings-Logo-Banner-300x176.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGO-Insiders-Member-Sale-Discounts-Savings-Logo-Banner-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 776px) 100vw, 776px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the Insiders Weekend 2026 goes live!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Insiders Weekend November 2026 Promotions Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026: </strong>Double Insiders Reward Points on LEGO purchases</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP gift set when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift set when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-26, 2026:</strong> Insiders Member Sale Price &amp; Discount on selected sets</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114904 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds.jpg" alt="" width="1316" height="548" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds.jpg 1316w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-300x125.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-1024x426.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-US-Thresholds-768x320.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1316px) 100vw, 1316px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
