<h3>LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP Set Revealed: Release Dates, Promo Period &amp; Release Dates</h3>
<h3>40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP November 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: N/A</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 10+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 231</li>
<li>Official Release Date: November 21, 2026</li>
<li>Promo Period: November 21-22, 2026 (Insiders Weekend)</li>
<li>Promo Offer (Insiders Only): Free with LEGO Purchases over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114893 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image.webp" alt="" width="1085" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image.webp 1085w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-271x300.webp 271w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-926x1024.webp 926w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-768x849.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-1024x1133.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1085px) 100vw, 1085px" />  <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114895 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2.webp" alt="" width="1051" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2.webp 1051w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2-263x300.webp 263w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2-897x1024.webp 897w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2-768x877.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-2-1024x1169.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1051px) 100vw, 1051px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114896 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114897 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-3.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="1161" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-3.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-3-300x290.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-3-1024x991.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-3-768x743.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114898 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4.webp" alt="" width="1148" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4.webp 1148w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4-287x300.webp 287w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4-980x1024.webp 980w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4-768x803.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Product-Image-4-1024x1070.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1148px) 100vw, 1148px" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114894" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="1185" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp 1185w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1011x1024.webp 1011w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-768x778.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1024x1037.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1185px) 100vw, 1185px" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114899" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-2.webp" alt="" width="800" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-2.webp 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-2-200x300.webp 200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-2-683x1024.webp 683w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Lifestyle-2-768x1152.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<p>40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP will be free when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) during Insiders Weekend from November 21-22, 2026. You need to be an Insiders Rewards Member to qualify (free to join). This set is branded as limited edition on the box.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="1182" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp 1182w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1009x1024.webp 1009w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-768x780.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1024x1040.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1182px) 100vw, 1182px" /></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
