		<item>
		<title>The Difference Between LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts and LEGOLAND Discovery Centers</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-difference-between-legoland-theme-park-resorts-and-legoland-discovery-centers/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-difference-between-legoland-theme-park-resorts-and-legoland-discovery-centers/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Contributor Writer]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:17:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND Resources]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114753</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="942" height="405" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND California Dino Valley Land Attraction Rides - Duplo Little Dino Trail, Explorer River Quest and Coastersaurus Roller Coaster" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster.jpg 942w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster-300x129.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster-768x330.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 942px) 100vw, 942px" /></p>
<p>If you want fun for your kids, both the resorts and the discovery centers deliver. They bring creativity</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-difference-between-legoland-theme-park-resorts-and-legoland-discovery-centers/">The Difference Between LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts and LEGOLAND Discovery Centers</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want fun for your kids, both the resorts and the discovery centers deliver. They bring creativity and imagination through fun rides and attractions, and both are ideal for kids ages 3 to 12. The difference between LEGOLAND Resorts and LEGOLAND Discovery Centers isn’t much but is still worth considering.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-104729 " src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1273" height="458" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page.jpg 1845w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page-300x108.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page-1024x369.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page-768x276.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Indoor-LEGO-Playgrounds-Banner-Landing-Page-1536x553.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1273px) 100vw, 1273px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Regarding numbers, LEGOLAND has only 3 resorts in the United States (</span><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a>) <span style="font-weight: 400;">and 11 worldwide. The discovery centers fare better in this regard with 14 locations in the country, spread across different states. So, if you want something closer to you, the probability of finding a Discovery Center is much higher.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For me, it isn’t about which location is closest but what I want from the experience. This guide will show you all you need to know, from what they offer in terms of rides to the packages available for families.</span></p>
<p><em>Shown below is the LEGOLAND Florida Battle of Bricksburg Theme Park Ride Attraction.</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114143 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Battle-of-Bricksburg-Theme-Park-Ride-Attraction-Banner.jpeg" alt="" width="800" height="533" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Battle-of-Bricksburg-Theme-Park-Ride-Attraction-Banner.jpeg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Battle-of-Bricksburg-Theme-Park-Ride-Attraction-Banner-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Battle-of-Bricksburg-Theme-Park-Ride-Attraction-Banner-768x512.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Takeaways</span></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Merlin Entertainments operates the LEGOLAND Resorts under a long-term license from the LEGO Group.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The LEGO Group owns and operates the LEGOLAND Discovery Centers after it completed the acquisition in February 2026.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The primary difference between LEGOLAND Resorts and LEGOLAND Discovery Centers is the size.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a> | <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.co.uk%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, UK</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.dk%2Fen%2Foffers%2F%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.de%2Fen%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-104724 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="550" height="189" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner.jpg 611w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner-300x103.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px" /></p>
<h3>Buy LEGO Discovery Center Tickets Around the World</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>US &amp; Canada &#8211; LEGOLAND Discovery Center Tickets at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Toronto, Canada</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Arizona, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Atlanta, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bay Area, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Boston, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chicago, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Columbus, US</a> | <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dallas, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXw" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kansas City, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXW" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Michigan, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXF" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New Jersey, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Philadelphia, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXP" target="_blank" rel="noopener">San Antonio, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Washington DC, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Westchester, US</a></li>
<li><strong>UK Europe &#8211; LEGOLAND Discovery Center Tickets at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Birmingham, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRN" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Manchester, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqc/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legodiscoverycentre.com%2Fbrussels%2Ftickets-annual-passes%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brussels, Belgium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqk/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legolanddiscoverycentre.com%2Fberlin%2Fen%2Ftickets%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Berlin, Germany</a> | <a href="https://merlineu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hamburg, Germany</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqm/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legolanddiscoverycentre.com%2Foberhausen%2Fen%2Ftickets%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Oberhausen, Germany</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqn/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legolanddiscoverycentre.com%2Foberhausen%2Fen%2Ftickets%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hague, Netherlands</a></li>
<li><strong>Australia &amp; Asia &#8211; LEGOLAND Discovery Center Tickets at Official Site: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Melbourne, Australia</a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRj/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legolanddiscoverycentre.com%2Fhong-kong%2Fen%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hong Kong, China</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Osaka, Japan</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-101954 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="583" height="164" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner.jpg 849w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner-300x84.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner-768x216.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 583px) 100vw, 583px" /></p>
<p><em>Don&#8217;t forget to subscribe to our email list so you don&#8217;t miss out on any LEGOLAND Travel Planning News and Deals!</em></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><em>Shown below are some of the LEGOLAND California Dino Valley Land Attraction Rides.</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106864 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster.jpg" alt="" width="942" height="405" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster.jpg 942w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster-300x129.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-California-Dino-Valley-Land-Attraction-Rides-Duplo-Little-Dino-Trail-Explorer-River-Quest-and-Coastersaurus-Roller-Coaster-768x330.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 942px) 100vw, 942px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">An Overview of the Difference Between LEGOLAND Resorts and LEGOLAND Discovery Centers</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Resorts offer an outdoor experience even though they have some indoor attractions like Galacticoaster and The Dragon. One of the first things you will notice when you step into one is the size–it’s large, some larger than others.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-105262 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign.jpg" alt="" width="1364" height="893" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign.jpg 1364w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-300x196.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-1024x670.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-California-Main-Front-Entrance-Logo-Banner-Welcome-Sign-768x503.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1364px) 100vw, 1364px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Depending on which resort, you will find not just rides in the theme park, but attractions in the water park. For me, the LEGOLAND Resort is the perfect blend of the outdoor-indoor experience for children. But get ready to walk, as these resorts typically span acres of land.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a> | <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.co.uk%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, UK</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.dk%2Fen%2Foffers%2F%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.de%2Fen%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Discover Centers, on the othe</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">r hand, are more modest in size. They aren’t as large as the resorts, making a one-day tour more feasible. Yes, you can walk around the entire center in one day, something I wouldn’t bet on if it were the resorts.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">But is that where the differences end? Not exactly. I see LEGOLAND Resorts as holiday centers. They are best suited for multi-day visits, even though you can still get away with a one-day itinerary–I still believe a two-day itinerary is the best, though. You just can’t cover the entire resort in one day with all the rides, except maybe if you are the Flash.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The discovery centers aren’t built for multi-day visits. Instead, they are perfect destinations if you want to breeze in with your kids for a few hours or maybe a day. You typically find them inside malls and retail hubs. Now, compare that to a resort that has enough land to accommodate several malls.</span></p>
<p><em>Shown below are some of the features at the </em><em><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Discovery Center in Boston, US</a>.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXp" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-104731 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA.jpg" alt="" width="1429" height="772" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA.jpg 1608w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA-300x162.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA-1024x553.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA-768x415.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Center-Attractions-Rides-Boston-MA-USA-1536x830.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1429px) 100vw, 1429px" /></a></p>
