					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Pokemon 72163 SMART Play Mewtwo&#039;s Lab Break Summer August 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Happy Sunday Morning Everyone! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/9-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-15-2026/">9 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 15, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Sunday Morning Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109056 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Pokemon-72163-SMART-Play-Mewtwos-Lab-Break-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals would probably be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-A-2026-72161/dp/B0G2T1HFD8?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=3132765f7cef3448f93f931acbc5ef99&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Pokémon SMART Play: Drone Search for Mythical Mew 72161</a> at 20% off for <strong>$39.99</strong> (reg.$49.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Pok%C3%A9mon-SMART-Play-Brick-Built/dp/B0G2T18T5F?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=20c2fe7a8467116b59c5712642c22398&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Pokémon SMART Play: Mewtwo&#8217;s Lab Break 72163</a> at 20% off for <strong>$55.99</strong> (reg.$69.99). You also can&#8217;t really go wrong with the 43% off <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Smart-Play/dp/B0FMYX7GPG?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=79f6d12cf74061c6a7bdc788032de822&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars SMART Play: Mos Eisley Cantina 75425</a> for <strong>$45.49</strong> (reg.$79.99). Note that SMART Bricks are not included in these ones. They are however SMART Brick compatible. You will need to purchase a SMART Brick All-in-One set that includes the SMART Brick.</p>
