										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114778 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box.jpg" alt="" width="614" height="819" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box.jpg 614w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box-225x300.jpg 225w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px" /></p>
<p>LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP is one of the current gift with purchase promotional item at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). It is free when you purchase the new LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). The promotion runs from November 1-20, 2026 (or while supplies last). There&#8217;s about six days left for this promotion. As of this review writing, LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP  is still available at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="983" height="983" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 983px) 100vw, 983px" /></p>
<p>Alternatively, you can also buy LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP by itself on secondary marketplaces like at <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> and <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a>. Current market prices for the gift set are going for around $70-85 USD (~$100-$120 CAD) plus shipping.</p>
