<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Box Packaging &amp; Contents &#8211; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP</span></h3>
<p>This is how the front of the box looks like.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114764 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Front-Box.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Front-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Front-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>This is how the top of the box looks like. It shows the 1:1 size of the life buoy. There&#8217;s also two printed pigeons, a briefcase accessory, camera and two minifigures.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114765 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Top-Box.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Top-Box.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Top-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Top-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>This is how the back of the box looks like. It shows an alternative view of the set along with the feature where you can lift off the passenger boat seat area.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114766 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Back-Box.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Back-Box-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Back-Box-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Dumping out the box, you get four numbered bags along with a instruction booklet. There are no stickers in this set which is very nice.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114767 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents.jpg" alt="" width="614" height="819" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents.jpg 614w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Box-Contents-225x300.jpg 225w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px" /></p>
<p>Near the end of the instruction booklet, it shows that you can connect this 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP gift set with the 11388 Venetian Neigborhood set.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114768 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Connects-with-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-Instructions.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Connects-with-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-Instructions.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Connects-with-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-Instructions-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Connects-with-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-Instructions-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The Build Process &#8211; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP </span></h3>
<p>For bag 1, you first start building the boat captain minifigure.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114769 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>This is how the back of the minifigure looks like.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114770 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Bag 1 basically builds the base of the water taxi boat. You also get two small spare extra pieces.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114771 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-1-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Bag 2 finishes the boat build. You also get more spare extra pieces.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114772 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-2-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Bag 3 starts with building the tourist / passenger minifigure. The minifigure has a camera accessory piece.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114773 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-3.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-3.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-3-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-3-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>There is an alternative face available for the minifigure as well. All you have to do is just turn the head piece.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114774 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-4.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-4.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-4-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Front-4-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>This is how the back of the passenger / tourist minifigure looks like.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114775 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-2.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-2.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Minifigure-Back-2-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Bag 3 basically also starts the process of building the dock. You build the base of it. There are a few spare extra pieces as well.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114776 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-3-Build.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-3-Build.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-3-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-3-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Bag 4 finishes off the build with the dock details. There&#8217;s quite a few extra spare pieces in bag 4. That basically completes the set!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114777 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-4-Build.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-4-Build.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-4-Build-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Bag-4-Build-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The Complete Set &amp; Final Thoughts &#8211; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP</span></h3>
<p>LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP is now complete. You can lift off the boat to seat two passengers in addition to the boat captain. There is also a little space at the back where you can store the briefcase accessory (cyan color) too. The dock is pretty nice too where there are two printed pigeon figures, lamppost and more.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114780 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-2.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-2.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-2-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>Here&#8217;s another view of the set. You can see the boat motor from this angle.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114779 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set.jpg" alt="" width="819" height="614" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set.jpg 819w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-768x576.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px" /></p>
<p>LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP is currently available at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). The promotion runs from November 1-20, 2026 (or while supplies last) and the Water Taxi Gift set is free when you buy the new LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This massive set has 5682 pieces and retails for $549.99 USD / $779.99 CAD / £449.99 GBP / $799.99 AUD.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="952" height="952" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 952px) 100vw, 952px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113620 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="895" height="873" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x293.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x999.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x749.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 895px) 100vw, 895px" /></p>
<p>You can also buy LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP by itself on secondary marketplaces (<a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> and <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a>). The gift set is going for around $70-85 USD (~$100-$120 CAD) plus shipping on secondary marketplaces.</p>
<p><strong>What do you think of the LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP? You can vote and <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3447-review-lego-icons-40898-venetian-water-taxi-gwp-november-2026-promo-gift-set/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">let us know in the forums</a>.</strong></p>
<p><em>Thank you to LEGO for providing Toys N Bricks a media copy sample of the LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP for us to review. </em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114778 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box.jpg" alt="" width="614" height="819" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box.jpg 614w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-Promo-November-2026-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Box-225x300.jpg 225w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px" /></p>
